<!--
    The crosshair on the "Capture current location" button in the place form.

    The standard "my location" target rather than a pin: a pin means "a saved place", which is what the
    button *produces*; the crosshair means "where I am now", which is what it *reads*. Keeping each
    mark to its own meaning keeps the two ideas distinct across the Places screens.

    Drawn white and tinted by the button's iconTint.
-->
